  "rdfs:comment": {
    "de": [
      "Der Pumptrack ist für Fahrräder, Roller, Inline-Skates und Skateboards gedacht und bietet nun vier Schwierigkeitsgrade, sodass jeder, unabhängig von Alter und Erfahrung, sicher fahren kann."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Designed for bikes, scooters, rollerblades and skateboards, pumptrack now offers four levels of difficulty, so that everyone can practice in complete safety, whatever their age or experience."
    ],
    "it": [
      "Adatto a biciclette, monopattini, rollerblade e skateboard, il pumptrack offre ora quattro livelli di difficoltà, in modo che tutti possano esercitarsi in totale sicurezza, indipendentemente dalla loro età o esperienza."
    ],
    "fr": [
      "Destiné aux vélos, trotinettes, rollers et skateboards, le pumptrack offre désormais quatre niveaux de difficulté permettant à chacun de pratiquer en toute sécurité quelque soit son âge ou son expérience."
    ],
    "nl": [
      "Pumptrack is geschikt voor fietsen, scooters, skeelers en skateboards en biedt nu vier moeilijkheidsniveaus, zodat iedereen in alle veiligheid kan oefenen, ongeacht leeftijd of ervaring."
    ],
    "es": [
      "Apto para bicicletas, patinetes, patines y monopatines, el pumptrack ofrece ahora cuatro niveles de dificultad, para que todo el mundo pueda practicar con total seguridad, sea cual sea su edad o experiencia."
    ]
  },
